    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know, i should check with my doc but they're super hard to get a hold of and i'm in a lot of pain right now. i've taken advil a million times before when i wasn't on the blood thinner and it was never an issue. is there really a big risk or is it just a standard precaution they tell everyone to take?",
